You will be pleased to hear that the study is now completed,
First phase shows some weak effects. Thank you for all you help in 2018.
We will be braving the snow of MA for xmas and I shall contact you from
Deerfield.
The card was made by our 13 year old grandson.
Have a great Holiday,
Peter
